      "title": "Observation upload coverage",
      "description": "Uploaded observations divided by expected source result/attempt rows across imports. This is import coverage, not Test262 conformance.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
